rtyard.\n\u2022 Controller ray selection, playback controls and recentering.\n\u2022 Offline playback after the complete app download.\n\u2022 One-time purchase; no in-app subscription or advertising.\n\nThe interface and instruction audio are in Chinese. Designed for Meta Quest 3 and Quest 3S. Practice standing with enough clear space to extend your arms and move safely.", "short_description": "Practice the eight movements of Ba Duan Jin in a peaceful virtual courtyard. Follow a life-size stereoscopic instructor, choose any section, and pause or replay at your own pace. Chinese interface and audio. For Meta Quest 3 and Quest 3S."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sr2.tech/baduanjin-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SquareRootTwo", "support_website_url": "https://sr2.tech/index.html#contact", "website_url": "https://sr2.tech/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1503707499481669"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1587076966557164"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1587076966557164"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1795359300, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1587076966557164"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "15036588061532